From 89926fb11a0f952dcd11dbde4d86a57d37780735 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: judgeou <judgeou@vip.qq.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Mar 2026 14:17:59 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Add webp_anim2png tool for decoding animated WebP files

This commit introduces a new tool, webp_anim2png, which decodes animated WebP files and saves each frame as PNG images in a designated folder. The tool is Windows-specific and includes options for outputting BMP frames for ffmpeg. Additionally, CMake configurations and Makefile updates have been made to support this new functionality.

Changes include:
- New source file: examples/webp_anim2png.c
- Updates to CMakeLists.txt to add build options for webp_anim2png
- Modifications to .gitignore to exclude build output directories
- New CMakeSettings.json for project configuration

This enhances the WebP toolset by providing a convenient way to handle animated WebP files.
